 fidelity on intricate detail, in exchange for longer generation times.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1"><span class="rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-hal text-2xs text-landing-ink">realism</span><span class="rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-hal text-2xs text-landing-ink">typography</span><span class="rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-hal text-2xs text-landing-ink">stylized</span></div></div></div></a><a href="/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/sunburst/edit" class="group block"><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-160 group-hover:shadow-md"><div class="relative aspect-395/361 w-full overflow-hidden bg-landing-surface"><img alt="GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst Edit " data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 395px" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fv3b.fal.media%2Ffiles%2Fb%2F0aa9a3b8%2FcSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.jpg/tr:w-640,q-80/cSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fv3b.fal.media%2Ffiles%2Fb%2F0aa9a3b8%2FcSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.jpg/tr:w-768,q-80/cSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fv3b.fal.media%2Ffiles%2Fb%2F0aa9a3b8%2FcSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.jpg/tr:w-896,q-80/cSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.webp 896w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fv3b.fal.media%2Ffiles%2Fb%2F0aa9a3b8%2FcSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.jpg/tr:w-1080,q-80/cSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.webp 1080w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fv3b.fal.media%2Ffiles%2Fb%2F0aa9a3b8%2FcSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.jpg/tr:w-1280,q-80/cSrDjg-ke-PcqgHiY_gxn.webp 1280w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fv3b.fal.media%2Ffiles%