nts-none absolute top-3 left-3"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Round 2</span></div></div><p class="mt-3 font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink/70">Hang a large framed abstract landscape print on the bare wall above the sofa. Leave the rest of the room exactly as it is.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface"><img alt="The same room at dusk, lit by warm interior lamplight, with the furniture and artwork identical" data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-256,q-80/edit-3.webp 256w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-384,q-80/edit-3.webp 384w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-512,q-80/edit-3.webp 512w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-640,q-80/edit-3.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-768,q-80/edit-3.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-896,q-80/edit-3.webp 896w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-1080,q-80/edit-3.webp 1080w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-1280,q-80/edit-3.webp 1280w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/edit-3.webp 1920w" src="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fedit-3.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/edit-3.webp"/><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-3 left-3"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Round 3</span></div></div><p class="mt-3 font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink/70">Change the time of day to evening: warm lamplight inside, blue dusk through the window. Keep the furniture, the artwork and the layout identical.</p></li></ol><p class="mt-6 max-w-[760px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink/60">Generated with openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/edit at high quality. Instructions reproduced verbatim.</p></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-landing-border bg-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="214" height="173" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[337px] left-0 hidden min-[1680px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/examples-dust-left.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/examples-dust-left.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/examples-dust-left.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="571" height="283" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[75px] right-0 hidden min-[1600px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/examples-dust-right.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/examples-dust-right.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/examples-dust-right.svg"/></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1237px] px-3 py-[50px] min-[1320px]:px-0 md:px-8 md:py-24 xl:py-[138px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-10"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-[5px] bg-transparent px-[7px] py-1.5 md:px-3 md:py-2.5 border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-heading font-medium text-landing-sm md:text-landing-title">Examples</span><h2 class="max-w-[824px] font-heading text-landing-h2-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-5xl xl:text-landing-h2">See what GPT Image 2.5 can create</h2><p class="max-w-[723px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Eight unrelated briefs, one model. Every image on this page is GPT Image 2.5&#x27;s own output, generated through these endpoints, with the prompt that produced it.</p></div><div class="mt-[30px] grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-[26px] gap-y-[25px] md:mt-[73px] md:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative w-full rounded-t-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 3"><img alt="AI-generated SaaS analytics dashboard with a sidebar, four stat tiles, a labelled revenue chart and an accounts table" data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 605px, 100vw" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ui-43.png/tr:w-640,q-80/ex-ui-43.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ui-43.png/tr:w-768,q-80/ex-ui-43.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ui-43.png/tr:w-896,q-80/ex-ui-43.webp 896w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ui-43.png/tr:w-1080,q-80/ex-ui-43.webp 1080w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ui-43.png/tr:w-1280,q-80/ex-ui-43.webp 1280w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ui-43.png/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-ui-43.webp 1920w" src="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ui-43.png/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-ui-43.webp"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-[13px] rounded-b-sm border border-t-0 border-landing-border bg-landing-surface p-[21px]"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Interface design</h3><p class="line-clamp-6 max-w-[542px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">&quot;<!-- -->A polished SaaS analytics dashboard filling the whole frame edge to edge, no browser chrome. A dark navy left sidebar with a small &#x27;Nexa&#x27; wordmark and legible nav items &#x27;Overview&#x27;, &#x27;Cohorts&#x27;, &#x27;Funnels&#x27;, &#x27;Retention&#x27;, &#x27;Billing&#x27;. Main area headed &#x27;Revenue overview&#x27; with four stat tiles reading &#x27;MRR $184,320&#x27;, &#x27;Net new $12,940&#x27;, &#x27;Churn 1.8%&#x27;, &#x27;Active seats 4,207&#x27;, a wide area chart titled &#x27;Monthly recurring revenue&#x27; with month labels Jan to Dec, and a table of five accounts with columns &#x27;Account&#x27;, &#x27;Plan&#x27;, &#x27;Seats&#x27;, &#x27;MRR&#x27;, &#x27;Status&#x27;. Clean modern interface design, generous whitespace, one indigo accent, crisp legible typography<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class="mt-auto"><button type="button" class="focus-ring w-fit rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-landing-border px-[13px] py-[11px] text-center font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink transition-colors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Copy Prompt</button></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative w-full rounded-t-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 3"><img alt="AI-generated environmental portrait of a ceramicist at her wheel in a sunlit studio lined with drying pottery" data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 605px, 100vw" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-portrait-wide.jpg/tr:w-640,q-80/ex-portrait-wide.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-portrait-wide.jpg/tr:w-768,q-80/ex-portrait-wide.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-portrait-wide.jpg/tr:w-896,q-80/ex-portrait-wide.webp 896w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-portrait-wide.jpg/tr:w-1080,q-80/ex-portrait-wide.webp 1080w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-portrait-wide.jpg/tr:w-1280,q-80/ex-portrait-wide.webp 1280w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-portrait-wide.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-portrait-wide.webp 1920w" src="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-portrait-wide.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-portrait-wide.webp"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-[13px] rounded-b-sm border border-t-0 border-landing-border bg-landing-surface p-[21px]"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Portraiture</h3><p class="line-clamp-6 max-w-[542px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">&quot;<!-- -->A photorealistic candid environmental portrait, landscape framing: a ceramicist in her fifties at her wheel in a sunlit studio, seen from the side with room around her, clay-dusted apron and forearms, greying hair tied back, laugh lines and visible skin texture, looking just off camera mid-conversation. Shelves of drying bisqueware fill the right of the frame, soft north light from a tall window on the left. Shot on 50mm at f/2.8, 35mm film colour<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class="mt-auto"><button type="button" class="focus-ring w-fit rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-landing-border px-[13px] py-[11px] text-center font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink transition-colors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Copy Prompt</button></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative w-full rounded-t-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 3"><img alt="AI-generated overhead shot of an independent magazine with an oversized masthead, underwater cover photograph and legible cover lines" data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 605px, 100vw" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-editorial-wide.jpg/tr:w-640,q-80/ex-editorial-wide.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-editorial-wide.jpg/tr:w-768,q-80/ex-editorial-wide.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-editorial-wide.jpg/tr:w-896,q-80/ex-editorial-wide.webp 896w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-editorial-wide.jpg/tr:w-1080,q-80/ex-editorial-wide.webp 1080w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-editorial-wide.jpg/tr:w-1280,q-80/ex-editorial-wide.webp 1280w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-editorial-wide.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-editorial-wide.webp 1920w" src="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-editorial-wide.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-editorial-wide.webp"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-[13px] rounded-b-sm border border-t-0 border-landing-border bg-landing-surface p-[21px]"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Editorial and print</h3><p class="line-clamp-6 max-w-[542px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">&quot;<!-- -->An overhead landscape photograph of an independent magazine lying on a pale concrete table, shot straight down with the whole cover inside the frame. The cover has a deep ultramarine background, an oversized condensed serif masthead reading &#x27;FATHOM&#x27;, a photograph of a free diver silhouetted against underwater light shafts, and cover lines in small clean sans reading &#x27;THE LAST QUIET PLACES&#x27;, &#x27;What 200 metres does to a body&#x27; and &#x27;Issue 14 / Depth&#x27;. A pair of reading glasses and a coffee cup sit to the right. Soft daylight, premium print art direction<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class="m