ors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Copy Prompt</button></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative w-full rounded-t-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 3"><img alt="AI-generated architectural visualisation of a cantilevered concrete and timber house at dusk" data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 605px, 100vw" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-architecture-43.jpg/tr:w-640,q-80/ex-architecture-43.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-architecture-43.jpg/tr:w-768,q-80/ex-architecture-43.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-architecture-43.jpg/tr:w-896,q-80/ex-architecture-43.webp 896w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-architecture-43.jpg/tr:w-1080,q-80/ex-architecture-43.webp 1080w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-architecture-43.jpg/tr:w-1280,q-80/ex-architecture-43.webp 1280w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-architecture-43.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-architecture-43.webp 1920w" src="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-architecture-43.jpg/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-architecture-43.webp"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-[13px] rounded-b-sm border border-t-0 border-landing-border bg-landing-surface p-[21px]"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Architectural visualisation</h3><p class="line-clamp-6 max-w-[542px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">&quot;<!-- -->Architectural visualisation of a concrete and timber house at dusk, cantilevered over a rocky slope, floor-to-ceiling glazing glowing warm from within, a lap pool reflecting the last light, native grasses in the foreground. Board-formed concrete texture and oiled larch cladding both clearly readable, cool blue sky gradient, wide-angle architectural photography<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class="mt-auto"><button type="button" class="focus-ring w-fit rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-landing-border px-[13px] py-[11px] text-center font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink transition-colors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Copy Prompt</button></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative w-full rounded-t-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 3"><img alt="AI-generated hand-inked children&#x27;s book illustration of a girl and a bear sharing an umbrella at a tram stop" data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 605px, 100vw" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-illustration.jpg/tr:w-640,q-80/ex-illustration.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-illustration.jpg/tr:w-768,q-80/ex-illustration.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.b