r border-landing-border bg-landing-surface overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 3"><img alt="AI-generated e-commerce product photograph of an amber glass bottle and its carton with legible label text" data-state="closed" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;-webkit-touch-callout:none" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 605px, 100vw" srcSet="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ecommerce-43.png/tr:w-640,q-80/ex-ecommerce-43.webp 640w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ecommerce-43.png/tr:w-768,q-80/ex-ecommerce-43.webp 768w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ecommerce-43.png/tr:w-896,q-80/ex-ecommerce-43.webp 896w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ecommerce-43.png/tr:w-1080,q-80/ex-ecommerce-43.webp 1080w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ecommerce-43.png/tr:w-1280,q-80/ex-ecommerce-43.webp 1280w, https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ecommerce-43.png/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-ecommerce-43.webp 1920w" src="https://refinery.fal.media/url/https%3A%2F%2Fir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fgpt-image-2.5%2Fv2%2Fex-ecommerce-43.png/tr:w-1920,q-80/ex-ecommerce-43.webp"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-[13px] rounded-b-sm border border-t-0 border-landing-border bg-landing-surface p-[21px]"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Packaging and e-commerce</h3><p class="line-clamp-6 max-w-[542px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">&quot;<!-- -->A clean e-commerce product photograph on a seamless white background, landscape framing with generous space around the products: an amber glass apothecary bottle with a matte black pump, its label legible and reading &#x27;NORTHBOUND / facial oil / rosehip + sea buckthorn / 30 ml&#x27;, shown beside its folded card carton printed with the same wordmark and a small ingredient list. Even soft studio lighting, faint contact shadow, catalogue-ready<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class="mt-auto"><button type="button" class="focus-ring w-fit rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-landing-border px-[13px] py-[11px] text-center font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink transition-colors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Copy Prompt</button></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="pricing" class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-landing-border bg-landing-fill"><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1237px] px-3 py-[50px] min-[1320px]:px-0 md:px-8 md:py-24 xl:py-[138px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-10"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-[5px] bg-transparent px-[7px] py-1.5 md:px-3 md:py-2.5 border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-heading font-medium text-landing-sm md:text-landing-title">Pricing</span><h2 class="max-w-[824px] font-heading text-landing-h2-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-5xl xl:text-landing-h2">GPT Image 2.5 pricing</h2><p class="max-w-[723px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Cost per image at the canonical sizes. Flare and Sunburst are priced identically, so the variant choice is free. Editing costs a little more than generating, because the reference image is billed as input.</p></div><div class="mt-[30px] overflow-x-auto md:mt-[60px]"><table class="w-full min-w-[860px] border-collapse text-left"><thead><tr><th scope="col" rowSpan="2" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body align-bottom font-heading font-medium text-landing-ink">Size</th><th scope="colgroup" colSpan="3" class="border-b border-landing-border py-3 pr-6 text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-heading font-medium text-landing-ink">Text to image</th><th scope="colgroup" colSpan="3" class="border-b border-landing-border py-3 pr-6 text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-heading font-medium text-landing-ink">Editing</th></tr><tr><th scope="col" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">Low</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">Medium</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">High<!-- --> (default)</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">Low</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">Medium</th><th scope="col" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">High<!-- --> (default)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-heading font-medium"><span class="text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body block text-landing-ink">1024 x 768</span></th><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0041</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0091</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0362</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0124</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0174</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0445</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-heading font-medium"><span class="text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body block text-landing-ink">1024 x 1024</span><span class="block font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">Square</span></th><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0060</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0133</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0528</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0142</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0215</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0610</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-heading font-medium"><span class="text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body block text-landing-ink">1024 x 1536</span><span class="block font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">Portrait</span></th><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0048</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0104</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0413</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0131</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0186</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0495</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-heading font-medium"><span class="text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body block text-landing-ink">1920 x 1080</span><span class="block font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">Full HD</span></th><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0045</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0096</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0395</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0128</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0179</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0478</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-heading font-medium"><span class="text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body block text-landing-ink">2560 x 1440</span><span class="block font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">QHD</span></th><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0062</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0144</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0554</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0145</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0227</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0636</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-heading font-medium"><span class="text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body block text-landing-ink">3840 x 2160</span><span class="block font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60">4K, the maximum</span></th><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0112</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0260</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.1002</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0195</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.0343</td><td class="border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80">$0.1084</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-6 max-w-[860px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink/60">Every figure above is the amount fal actually billed for a real request to the endpoint, measured across the whole matrix on September 8, 2026, with a short prompt; a long prompt adds its own text-input tokens. Quality is the main lever on cost. Underneath the table the model bills by token: text at $5.00 per million input, images at $8.00 per million input and $30.00 per million output, with cached input at $1.25 and $2.00, and the total rounded up to the nearest $0.0001. Edit figures assume a single 1024 x 1024 reference image, which adds about $0.008; a larger reference adds more, about $0.012 at 3840 x 2160, and passing several adds more again. The xhigh and max quality levels spend more tokens than high. <!-- -->Information updated as of September 10, 2026.</p></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-landing-border bg-landing-fill"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="510" height="376" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[80px] right-0 hidden min-[1600px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-grid.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-grid.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-grid.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="45" height="602" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[334px] left-0 hidden mix-blend-multiply min-[1600px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-realtime.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-realtime.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-realtime.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="66" height="647" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[78px] left-[26px] hidden mix-blend-multiply min-[1600px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-lightning.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-lightning.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-lightning.svg"/></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1237px] px-3 py-[50px] min-[1320px]:px-0 md:px-8 md:py-24 xl:py-[138px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-10"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-[5px] bg-transparent px-[7px] py-1.5 md:px-3 md:py-2.5 border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-heading font-medium text-landing-sm md:text-landing-title">API Documentation</span><h2 class="max-w-[824px] font-heading text-landing-h2-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-5xl xl:text-landing-h2">How to call the GPT Image 2.5 API</h2><p class="max-w-[723px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">The client handles the queue protocol, polls for status and returns the result when the request completes. All four endpoints take the same parameters.</p></div><div class="mt-[30px] flex flex-col gap-[11px] md:mt-[73px]"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div role="tablist" class="inline-flex w-max gap-1.5 rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white p-1 md:gap-2 md:p-[7px]"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-landing-glow text-landing-ink">JavaScript</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">Python</button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div role="tablist" class="inline-flex w-max gap-1.5 rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white p-1 md:gap-2 md:p-[7px]"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-landing-glow text-landing-ink">Flare: text to image</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">Sunburst: 4K detail</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">Editing</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">Transparent background</button></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white p-2 text-landing-sm md:p-[15px] md:text-base"><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap border font-sans font-semibold focus-ring cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none data-disabled:pointer-events-none rounded-sm transform-gpu [&amp;:not([data-state]):not([data-disabled]):not(:disabled)]:active:scale-[0.98] [&amp;&gt;svg]:stroke-[1.5] transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform,opacity] duration-160 ease-out-quad border-transparent bg-transparent text-content-base [&amp;[data-state=open]:not([data-disabled])]:bg-surface-alpha disabled:border-transparent! disabled:bg-transparent! disabled:text-content-disabled! disabled:opacity-50 data-disabled:border-transparent data-disabled:bg-transparent data-disabled:text-content-disabled data-disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;:disabled&gt;svg]:text-content-disabled! [&amp;[data-disabled]&gt;svg]:text-content-disabled h-9 w-9 gap-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-current group/copy hover:bg-surface-alpha dark:hover:bg-surface-alpha" name="copyCode"><span class="pointer-events-none inline-grid size-4"><span class="transition-[opacity,filter,transform] duration-160 ease-out-quint [grid-area:1/1] scale-100 opacity-100 blur-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" width="24" height="24" color="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="size-full text-content-muted transition-colors duration-160 group-hover/copy:text-content-strong"><path stroke-linecap="square" d="M15 15v6H3V9h6m12 6H9V3h12z"></path></svg></span><span class="transition-[opacity,filter,transform] duration-160 ease-out-quint [grid-area:1/1] scale-[0.92] opacity-0 blur-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" width="24" height="24" color="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="size-full text-success-900 dark:text-success-400"><path stroke-linecap="square" d="m5 14 4.2 4L19 7"></path></svg></span></span></button></div><pre style="margin:0;font-family:var(--font-hal-mono);font-size:inherit;line-height:1.35;white-space:pre-wrap;background:transparent;padding:0;overflow-wrap:break-word"><code style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-hal-mono);font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap">import { fal } from &quot;@fal-ai/client&quot;;

const result = await fal.subscribe(&quot;openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image&quot;, {
  input: {
    prompt:
      &quot;A SaaS analytics dashboard with a left sidebar, four stat tiles and a labelled revenue chart, clean modern interface design&quot;,
    image_size: &quot;landscape_4_3&quot;,
    quality: &quot;high&quot;,
  },
  logs: true,
  onQueueUpdate: (update) =&gt; {
    if (update.status === &quot;IN_PROGRESS&quot;) {
      update.logs.map((log) =&gt; log.message).forEach(console.log);
    }
  },
});

console.log(result.data);
console.log(result.requestId);</code></pre></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-landing-border bg-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="234" height="202" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[34px] right-0 hidden lg:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/industries-cluster-right.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/industries-cluster-right.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/industries-cluster-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="185" height="98" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[514px] left-0 hidden min-[1600px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/industries-cluster-left.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/industries-cluster-left.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/industries-cluster-left.svg"/></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1237px] px-3 py-[50px] min-[1320px]:px-0 md:px-8 md:py-24 xl:py-[138px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-10"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-[5px] bg-transparent px-[7px] py-1.5 md:px-3 md:py-2.5 border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-heading font-medium text-landing-sm md:text-landing-title">Use Cases</span><h2 class="max-w-[824px] font-heading text-landing-h2-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-5xl xl:text-landing-h2">What teams are building with GPT Image 2.5</h2><p class="max-w-[723px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Packaging, product photography, advertising and information design, all of which lean on type staying legible and subjects staying consistent.</p></div><div class="mt-[30px] grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-[26px] gap-y-[25px] sm:grid-cols-2 md:mt-[73px] lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Product and design teams</span><h3 class="max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Interface concepts with real content in them</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Dashboards, marketing pages and app screens come out with working navigation, plausible data and legible labels, so a direction can be judged as a design rather than as a grey box.</p></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Editorial and publishing</span><h3 class="max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Covers, spreads and posters that set properly</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Oversized headlines, cover lines, standfirsts and small print hold their hierarchy, which is what lets a layout be reviewed before anyone opens a page-layout tool.</p></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Information design</span><h3 class="max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Diagrams, charts and technical illustration</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Labelled cross-sections, axis values, leader lines and multi-column copy stay coherent across a whole page, at sizes up to 4K.</p></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">E-commerce and packaging</span><h3 class="max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Catalogue shots and cutouts ready for the layout</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Labels and cartons render with readable copy, and transparent backgrounds come back as a real alpha channel, so product images drop into a template without a separate masking pass.</p></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Photography and campaigns</span><h3 class="max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Portraits, food, interiors and architecture</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Skin texture, hard sunlight, material finishes and dusk exteriors all sit within the same model, so a campaign can hold one look across very different shots.</p></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Illustration and brand</span><h3 class="max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]">Styles beyond photorealism</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Gouache, ink, flat vector and print styles are all reachable from a prompt, and the edit endpoints hold a subject recognisable as it moves between them.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-landing-border bg-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="397" height="276" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[38px] right-[153px] hidden xl:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/faq-cluster-right.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/faq-cluster-right.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/faq-cluster-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="236" height="338" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[18px] left-[3px] hidden min-[1720px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/faq-cluster-left.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/faq-cluster-left.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/faq-cluster-left.svg"/></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1237px] px-3 py-[50px] min-[1320px]:px-0 md:px-8 md:py-24 xl:py-[138px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-10"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-[5px] bg-transparent px-[7px] py-1.5 md:px-3 md:py-2.5 border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-heading font-medium text-landing-sm md:text-landing-title">FAQ</span><h2 class="max-w-[824px] font-heading text-landing-h2-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-5xl xl:text-landing-h2">Common questions about GPT Image 2.5</h2></div><div class="mt-[30px] divide-y divide-landing-border border-b border-landing-border md:mt-10"><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What is GPT Image 2.5?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">GPT Image 2.5 is OpenAI&#x27;s image model, available on fal in two variants. Flare is the default for most applications, with fast, high-quality generation, natural lighting and support for complex layouts. Sunburst is the precision-focused variant, built for premium visual work, spending longer on a request in exchange for extra fidelity on intricate detail. Each variant has a text-to-image endpoint and an editing endpoint, four in total.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What is the difference between Flare and Sunburst?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">They are two tunings of the same model with an identical API. Flare is the everyday choice and returns faster. Sunburst spends longer and holds finer detail, which matters when the image will be viewed large or cropped into. On the editing side, Flare changes only what is asked while keeping subject, composition and background intact, and Sunburst offers the tightest control across many rounds of revision. Pricing is the same for both, so the choice is about detail and generation time rather than cost.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How much does GPT Image 2.5 cost?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Cost depends on the size, the quality setting and whether you are generating or editing. Generating at the default high quality, a 1024 x 768 image is $0.0362, Full HD is $0.0395 and 4K is $0.1002. Dropping to medium takes those to $0.0091, $0.0096 and $0.0260, and low quality starts at $0.0041. Editing the same sizes costs a little more, because the reference image is billed as image input: $0.0445, $0.0478 and $0.1084 at high quality, and $0.0124 upward at low. Those edit figures assume one 1024 x 1024 reference, which adds about $0.008 on its own; a 3840 x 2160 reference adds about $0.012, and passing several references adds more again. Flare and Sunburst are priced identically, so choosing between them never costs anything. Underneath, the model bills by token: text at $5.00 per million input, and images at $8.00 per million input and $30.00 per million output, with cached input cheaper, and the total rounded up to $0.0001. There is no charge for text output.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What resolutions does GPT Image 2.5 support?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Presets cover square, portrait and landscape at 4:3 and 16:9, and &#x27;auto&#x27; lets the model pick. You can also pass an explicit width and height: both edges must be multiples of 16, the long edge caps at 3840px, the aspect ratio at 3:1, and the total pixel count must fall between 655,360 and 8,294,400. That puts 4K at 3840 x 2160 within reach.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What are the quality settings?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Six: auto, low, medium, high, xhigh and max. The default is high. Higher settings increase detail, latency and token usage, so quality is the main lever on what a request costs. This is a step up from GPT Image 2, which topped out at high.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can it generate transparent backgrounds?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Yes. Set background to &#x27;transparent&#x27; and choose PNG or WebP output, and the image comes back with a real alpha channel, ready to composite. JPEG has no alpha channel, so pair transparency with PNG or WebP.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How does image editing work?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">The edit endpoints take a prompt plus up to 16 reference images, and an optional mask URL when the change should be confined to a region. Feed one round&#x27;s output back in as the next round&#x27;s input to revise iteratively: the subject and composition carry through while each instruction changes one thing.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What is new in GPT Image 2.5?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">OpenAI&#x27;s launch notes give Flare higher image quality than GPT Image 2 at 50% lower latency, along with sharper detail, more natural lighting and richer textures. Style adherence is stronger from one generation to the next, subjects from reference photos are better preserved, and editing instructions are followed more reliably across multiple turns, with earlier edits more likely to carry through. Complex layouts and transparent backgrounds are handled better. On the API surface, quality gains two levels above the old ceiling, xhigh and max.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How does GPT Image 2.5 compare to GPT Image 2?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">GPT Image 2.5<!-- --> adds two quality levels above the old ceiling, xhigh and max, and splits into two variants so a request can be pointed at speed or at detail. Both generations remain available on fal, and<!-- --> <a class="text-landing-accent hover:underline" href="/gpt-image-2">GPT Image 2</a> <!-- -->keeps its own page and endpoints.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can I use GPT Image 2.5 for commercial projects?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Yes. Images generated through the fal API can be used in commercial projects. Check fal&#x27;s<!-- --> <a href="https://fal.ai/legal/terms-of-service" class="text-landing-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">terms of service</a> <!-- -->for full details on usage rights and licensing.</p></details><details class="group py-[15px]"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How do I get started with the API?<svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Install the fal SDK for Python or JavaScript, grab an API key from your<!-- --> <a class="text-landing-accent hover:underline" href="/dashboard/keys">dashboard</a>, and make your first request in a few lines of code. Serverless, with no GPUs to manage. The<!-- --> <a class="text-landing-accent hover:underline" href="/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image/api">API documentation</a> <!-- -->lists every parameter.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-landing-border bg-landing-fill"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="332" height="320" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[102px] right-[60px] hidden xl:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-illustration.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-illustration.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-illustration.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="75" height="210" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[453px] left-0 hidden 2xl:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-edge-dust-left.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-edge-dust-left.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-edge-dust-left.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="238" height="367" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-[387px] left-[6px] hidden min-[1730px]:block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-cluster-left.svg 1x, /landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-cluster-left.svg 2x" src="/landing/v2/_decor/blue/steps-cluster-left.svg"/></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1237px] px-3 py-[50px] min-[1320px]:px-0 md:px-8 md:py-24 xl:py-[138px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-10"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-[5px] bg-transparent px-[7px] py-1.5 md:px-3 md:py-2.5 border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-heading font-medium text-landing-sm md:text-landing-title">Getting Started</span><h2 class="max-w-[824px] font-heading text-landing-h2-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-5xl xl:text-landing-h2">GPT Image 2.5 API integration steps</h2><p class="max-w-[723px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body">Up and running in minutes. No GPUs to manage and no infrastructure to set up.</p></div><div class="mt-[30px] grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-[26px] gap-y-[25px] md:mt-[73px] md:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex flex-col gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg">1<!-- -->.  <!-- -->Install the client</h3><div class="max-w-[440px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body [&amp;_a]:text-landing-accent [&amp;_a:hover]:underline">Pick your package manager. For Python, use pip.</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div role="tablist" class="inline-flex w-max gap-1.5 rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white p-1 md:gap-2 md:p-[7px]"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-landing-glow text-landing-ink">npm</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">yarn</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">pnpm</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">bun</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="rounded-xs px-2 py-1.5 font-heading text-landing-sm leading-[0.86] font-medium whitespace-nowrap md:px-3 md:py-2.5 md:text-landing-title md:leading-(--text-landing-title--line-height) focus-ring transition-colors duration-160 bg-transparent text-landing-ink hover:bg-landing-surface">pip</button></div></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white p-1.5 font-hal-mono text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:p-3 md:text-base">npm install --save @fal-ai/client</pre></div></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex flex-col gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg">2<!-- -->.  <!-- -->Create an account on fal</h3><div class="max-w-[440px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body [&amp;_a]:text-landing-accent [&amp;_a:hover]:underline"><a href="/login">Sign up</a> to get access to the dashboard and your API keys.</div></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex flex-col gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg">3<!-- -->.  <!-- -->Get your API key</h3><div class="max-w-[440px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body [&amp;_a]:text-landing-accent [&amp;_a:hover]:underline">Locate your API credentials in the<!-- --> <a href="/dashboard/keys">developer dashboard</a>. Set<!-- --> <code class="rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-hal-mono text-landing-sm">FAL_KEY</code> as an environment variable in your runtime.</div></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex flex-col gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg">4<!-- -->.  <!-- -->Pick a variant and submit</h3><div class="max-w-[440px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body [&amp;_a]:text-landing-accent [&amp;_a:hover]:underline">Call <code class="rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 font-hal-mono text-landing-sm">fal.subscribe()</code> with a Flare or Sunburst endpoint. The client handles the async queue and returns the image URLs when the request completes.</div></div></div><div class="mt-[25px] grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-white p-[27px] md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-0 md:divide-x md:divide-landing-ink"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 md:px-6 md:first:pl-0 md:last:pr-0"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Try it now</span><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-h3-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-2xl xl:text-landing-h3">No setup required</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Generate with GPT Image 2.5 in the playground. Describe the image, pick Flare or Sunburst, and hit generate.</p><a href="/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image" class="mt-auto rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-landing-border px-[13px] py-[11px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink transition-colors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Open Playground<!-- --> →</a></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 md:px-6 md:first:pl-0 md:last:pr-0"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">For developers</span><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-h3-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-2xl xl:text-landing-h3">Integrate via API</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">Grab an API key and call any of the four GPT Image 2.5 endpoints. Python and JavaScript SDKs, plus a REST API for any language.</p><a href="/dashboard/keys" class="mt-auto rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-landing-border px-[13px] py-[11px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink transition-colors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Get API Key<!-- --> →</a></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 md:px-6 md:first:pl-0 md:last:pr-0"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm">Editing</span><h3 class="font-heading text-landing-h3-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-2xl xl:text-landing-h3">Start from an image you already have</h3><p class="font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink">The edit endpoints take up to 16 reference images and an optional mask, and hold the subject across successive rounds.</p><a href="/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/edit" class="mt-auto rounded-xs border border-landing-border bg-landing-border px-[13px] py-[11px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink transition-colors duration-160 hover:border-landing-accent-soft hover:bg-landing-accent-soft">Open the edit endpoint<!-- --> →</a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-landing-border bg-white"><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1237px] px-3 py-[50px] min-[1320px]:px-0 md:px-8 md:py-24 xl:py-[138px] flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center md:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:gap-10 items-center text-center"><h2 class="max-w-[824px] font-heading text-landing-h2-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-heading-5xl xl:text-landing-h2 text-center">Explore more models</h2></div><ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 md:gap-3"><li><a class="inline-flex" href="/gpt-image-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-landing-accent-soft px-[5px] py-[2px] md:px-[11px] md:py-[3px] border-landing-border text-landing-ink font-hal text-landing-sm md:text-landing-body transition-colors hover:border-landing-accent">GPT Image 2</span></a></li><li><a