 spends longer to hold intricate detail. Both generate from text and edit existing images, at up to 3840px.\",\"inputPlaceholder\":\"Describe your image\",\"samplePrompts\":[\"A SaaS dashboard with legible stat tiles and a labelled chart\",\"A transit map with legible station names and a legend\",\"A candid studio portrait on 85mm at f/2\",\"A Swiss exhibition poster with a huge grotesk headline\"],\"destinationHref\":\"/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image\",\"note\":\"Your prompt opens in the GPT Image 2.5 Flare playground, ready to generate.\",\"heroImageSrc\":\"https://ir7z8qsacw4tk54b.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/gpt-image-2.5/v2/hero-fal.jpg\",\"heroImageAlt\":\"AI-generated photograph of a design studio pinboard, centred on a printed style guide headed GPT Image 2.5 Live on fal, surrounded by colour swatches, an annotated wireframe, a floor plan and a launch schedule, all legible\",\"heroCaption\":\"Made with GPT Image 2.5\",\"ctas\":[{\"label\":\"Flare\",\"href\":\"/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/text-to-image?utm_source=landing\u0026utm_campaign=gpt-image-2.5\u0026utm_content=hero-cta\",\"variant\":\"primary\"},{\"label\":\"Sunburst\",\"href\":\"/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/sunburst/text-to-image?utm_source=landing\u0026utm_campaign=gpt-image-2.5\u0026utm_content=hero-cta\"},{\"label\":\"Edit an image\",\"href\":\"/models/openai/gpt-image-2.5/flare/edit?utm_source=landing\u0026utm_campaign=gpt-image-2.5\u0026utm_content=hero-cta\"}],\"decor\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L35\",null,{\"src\":\"/landing/v2/_decor/blue/hero-blob-right.svg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"width\":398,\"height\":364,\"className\":\"absolute top-[144px] right-0 hidden 2xl:block\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"$L35\",null,{\"src\":\"/landing/v2/_decor/blue/hero-cluster-right.svg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"width\":236,\"height\":338,\"className\":\"absolute top-[163px] right-[397px] hidden 2xl:block\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"$L35\",null,{\"src\":\"/landing/v2/_decor