ing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.0145\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.0227\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.0636\"}]]]}]\n69:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3840 x 2160\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap font-heading font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body block text-landing-ink\",\"children\":\"3840 x 2160\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"block font-hal text-landing-sm font-normal text-landing-ink/60\",\"children\":\"4K, the maximum\"}]]}],[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.0112\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.0260\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.1002\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.0195\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.0343\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-landing-border py-4 pr-6 whitespace-nowrap text-landing-body-m md:text-landing-body font-hal text-landing-ink/80\",\"children\":\"$$0.1084\"}]]]}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 max-w-[860px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink/60\",\"children\":[\"Every figure above is the amount fal actually billed for a real request to the endpoint, measured across the whole matrix on September 8, 2026, with a short prompt; a long prompt adds its own text-input tokens. Quality is the main lever on cost. Underneath the table the model bills by token: text at $5.00 per million input, images at $8.00 per million input and $30.00 per million output, with cached input at $1.25 and $2.00, and the total rounded up to the nearest $0.0001. Edit figures assume a single 1024 x 1024 reference image, which adds about $0.008; a larger reference adds more, about $0.012 at 3840 x 2160, and passing several adds more again. The xhigh and max quality levels spend more tokens than high. \",\"Information updated as of September 10, 2026.\"]}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L35\",null,{\"src\":\"/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-grid.svg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"width\":510,\"height\":376,\"className\":\"absolute top-[80px] right-0 hidden min-[1600px]:block\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"$L35\",null,{\"src\":\"/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-realtime.svg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"width\":45,\"height\":602,\"className\":\"absolute top-[334px] left-0 hidden mix-blend-multiply min-[1600px]:block\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"$L35\",null,{\"src\":\"/landing/v2/_decor/blue/api-docs-text-lightning.svg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"width\":66,\"height\":647,\"className\":\"absolute top-[78px] left-[26px] hidden mix-blend-multiply min-[1600px]:block\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}]]}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm\",\"children\":\"Information design\"}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]\",\"children\":\"Diagrams, charts and technical illustration\"}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink\",\"children\":\"Labelled cross-sections, axis values, leader lines and multi-column copy stay coherent across a whole page, at sizes up to 4K.\"}]\n70:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Catalogue shots and cutouts ready for the layout-3\",{\"className\":\"rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm\",\"children\":\"E-commerce and packaging\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]\",\"children\":\"Catalogue shots and cutouts ready for the layout\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink\",\"children\":\"Labels and cartons render with readable copy, and transparent backgrounds come back as a real alpha channel, so product images drop into a template without a separate masking pass.\"}]]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Portraits, food, interiors and architecture-4\",{\"className\":\"rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm\",\"children\":\"Photography and campaigns\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]\",\"children\":\"Portraits, food, interiors and architecture\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink\",\"children\":\"Skin texture, hard sunlight, material finishes and dusk exteriors all sit within the same model, so a campaign can hold one look across very different shots.\"}]]}]\n72:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Styles beyond photorealism-5\",{\"className\":\"rounded-sm border border-landing-border bg-landing-surface flex min-h-[196px] flex-col items-start gap-[13px] p-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex w-fit items-center border rounded-xs bg-white px-[11px] py-[3px] border-landing-accent text-landing-accent font-hal text-landing-sm\",\"children\":\"Illustration and brand\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[304px] font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-title md:leading-[1.08]\",\"children\":\"Styles beyond photorealism\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink\",\"children\":\"Gouache, ink, flat vector and print styles are all reachable from a prompt, and the edit endpoints hold a subject recognisable as it moves between them.\"}]]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How much does GPT Image 2.5 cost?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"How much does GPT Image 2.5 cost?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":\"Cost depends on the size, the quality setting and whether you are generating or editing. Generating at the default high quality, a 1024 x 768 image is $0.0362, Full HD is $0.0395 and 4K is $0.1002. Dropping to medium takes those to $0.0091, $0.0096 and $0.0260, and low quality starts at $0.0041. Editing the same sizes costs a little more, because the reference image is billed as image input: $0.0445, $0.0478 and $0.1084 at high quality, and $0.0124 upward at low. Those edit figures assume one 1024 x 1024 reference, which adds about $0.008 on its own; a 3840 x 2160 reference adds about $0.012, and passing several references adds more again. Flare and Sunburst are priced identically, so choosing between them never costs anything. Underneath, the model bills by token: text at $5.00 per million input, and images at $8.00 per million input and $30.00 per million output, with cached input cheaper, and the total rounded up to $0.0001. There is no charge for text output.\"}]]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"details\",\"What resolutions does GPT Image 2.5 support?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"What resolutions does GPT Image 2.5 support?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":\"Presets cover square, portrait and landscape at 4:3 and 16:9, and 'auto' lets the model pick. You can also pass an explicit width and height: both edges must be multiples of 16, the long edge caps at 3840px, the aspect ratio at 3:1, and the total pixel count must fall between 655,360 and 8,294,400. That puts 4K at 3840 x 2160 within reach.\"}]]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"details\",\"What are the quality settings?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"What are the quality settings?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":\"Six: auto, low, medium, high, xhigh and max. The default is high. Higher settings increase detail, latency and token usage, so quality is the main lever on what a request costs. This is a step up from GPT Image 2, which topped out at high.\"}]]}]\n76:[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can it generate transparent backgrounds?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"Can it generate transparent backgrounds?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":\"Yes. Set background to 'transparent' and choose PNG or WebP output, and the image comes back with a real alpha channel, ready to composite. JPEG has no alpha channel, so pair transparency with PNG or WebP.\"}]]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How does image editing work?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"How does image editing work?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":\"The edit endpoints take a prompt plus up to 16 reference images, and an optional mask URL when the change should be confined to a region. Feed one round's output back in as the next round's input to revise iteratively: the subject and composition carry through while each instruction changes one thing.\"}]]}]\n78:[\"$\",\"details\",\"What is new in GPT Image 2.5?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"What is new in GPT Image 2.5?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":\"OpenAI's launch notes give Flare higher image quality than GPT Image 2 at 50% lower latency, along with sharper detail, more natural lighting and richer textures. Style adherence is stronger from one generation to the next, subjects from reference photos are better preserved, and editing instructions are followed more reliably across multiple turns, with earlier edits more likely to carry through. Complex layouts and transparent backgrounds are handled better. On the API surface, quality gains two levels above the old ceiling, xhigh and max.\"}]]}]\n79:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How does GPT Image 2.5 compare to GPT Image 2?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"How does GPT Image 2.5 compare to GPT Image 2?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":[\"GPT Image 2.5\",\" adds two quality levels above the old ceiling, xhigh and max, and splits into two variants so a request can be pointed at speed or at detail. Both generations remain available on fal, and\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L7d\",null,{\"href\":\"/gpt-image-2\",\"className\":\"text-landing-accent hover:underline\",\"children\":\"GPT Image 2\"}],\" \",\"keeps its own page and endpoints.\"]}]]}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can I use GPT Image 2.5 for commercial projects?\",{\"className\":\"group py-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-heading text-landing-title-m font-medium text-landing-ink md:text-landing-lg [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[\"Can I use GPT Image 2.5 for commercial projects?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-landing-accent transition-transform duration-160 group-open:rotate-45\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 mb-2 max-w-[1000px] font-hal text-landing-sm text-landing-ink md:text-landing-body\",\"children\":[\"Yes. Images generated through the fal API can be used in commercial projects. Check fal's\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://fal.ai/legal/terms-of-service\",\"className\":\"text-landing-accent hover:underline\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"terms of service\"}],\" \",\"for full details on usage rights and licensing.\"]}]]}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How do I get started with the API?\",{\"cla